olumn-std units (equal weight per held-out model) against column-mean imputation, evaluator-seeded random-k ridge and greedy-forward-selection ridge baselines, with evaluator-owned permuted/constant negative controls. Bounded claim: lower held-out error than history-only column-mean imputation and than random-k selection with the same imputer, as an empirical error-vs-k curve, on family-group-disjoint held-out models of the three pinned leaderboards only.\"\n },\n \"candidate\": {\n  \"interface\": \"python_rpc_v1:handle\",\n  \"editable_paths\": [\n   \"program_0/src\"\n  ]\n },\n \"evaluators\": {\n  \"search\": \"evaluate.py\",\n  \"final\": \"evaluate_final.py\"\n },\n \"resources\": {\n  \"search_root\": \"resources/search\",\n  \"final_root\": \"resources/final\",\n  \"public_artifact_bundle\": null\n },\n \"data\": {\n  \"search_roles\": [\n   \"search_mteb\"\n  ],\n  \"final_roles\": [\n   \"final_mteb\",\n   \"final_oll\",\n   \"final_helm\",\n   \"final_combined_families\"\n  ]\n },\n \"metrics\": {\n  \"search\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"combined_score\",\n    \"data_role\": \"search_mteb\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"search_nrmse\",\n    \"data_role\": \"search_mteb\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"search_skill_vs_random_selection\",\n    \"data_role\": \"search_mteb\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"search_permuted_control_gap\",\n    \"data_role\": \"search_mteb\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"final\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"final_score\",\n    \"data_role\": \"final_combined_families\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"final_nrmse\",\n    \"data_role\": \"final_combined_families\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"final_skill_vs_random_selection\",\n    \"data_role\": \"final_combined_families\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"final_skill_vs_greedy_ridge\",\n    \"data_role\": \"final_combined_families\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"final_nrmse_mteb\",\n    \"data_role\": \"final_mteb\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"final_nrmse_oll\",\n    \"data_role\": \"final_oll\"\n  